- `embedded-query-parity.test.js` compares ragged nested scalar-list queries, array aggregates/sorts, direct presence markers, native/GraphQL defaults, state-name outputs, joined cardinality and historical UTC Date parameters. Run it under America/New_York as well as the database version matrix.
